grid-columns: 1
grid-rows: 3

classes: {
  active: { style.fill: "lime"; style.stroke: "black" }
  inactive: { style.fill: "red"; style.opacity: 0.3; style.stroke: "red"; style.font-color: "black"}
  file: { shape: page }
  # active: { style.fill: "linear-gradient(black,lime,lime,black)"; style.stroke: "lime" }
  # inactive: { style.fill: "linear-gradient(black,red,red,black)"; style.stroke: "red"; style.opacity: "1"; style.font-color: "black"}
}


introduction: |md 

  # Orchestration Architect Workspace Configuration

  This diagram illustrates how the workspace and worktrees are linked.

|
config: |md

## Contents of `workspace.config`
  
      develop 0.8.0-dev
      assets  0.8.0-assets
      documentation  0.8.0-documents
